# .code_review_ignore — Excludes files from Category G (Naming Convention) checks only
# All other checks (HK, HASHDIFF, CTE, tests, etc.) still run on these files.
#
# IMPORTANT: This file is for NAMING exceptions only. Full path exclusions
# (models that skip ALL checks) are in code_review_config.py EXCLUDED_PATHS.
#
# Exclusions are PATH-SCOPED, not prefix-scoped. Do NOT add broad prefix
# patterns like "models/**/stg_*" — that would suppress naming checks on
# active bus_vault PIT staging helpers (66 models) that must be reviewed.
#
# Format: One relative path per line (from repo root). Glob patterns supported.
# Lines starting with # are comments. Blank lines are ignored.

